  "body": "Beautifully renovated and thoughtfully redesigned to the current building code, this exceptional home is practically brand new from top to bottom. Delivering the ultimate balance of modern luxury, structural peace of mind, and top-tier school zone convenience, this is a rare move-in-ready masterpiece designed for modern family living.\r\nKey Property Features:\r\n•Immaculate Exterior & Roof Upgrade: Featuring a brand-new contemporary weatherboard exterior (rusticated & vertical profile), completely upgraded modern roof system, and external gutters.\r\n•Total Interior & Systems Overhaul: Completely re-plumbed, re-wired, insulated and double-glazed throughout.\r\n•Spacious Multi-Generational Layout: Featuring 5 bedrooms, 4 bathrooms (including 2 master ensuites), and 2 generous living areas across two levels.\r\n•Ground Floor Convenience: Features a formal, independent lounge, an open-plan dining and contemporary kitchen boasting abundant storage, plus a convenient semi-ensuite guest/family suite-ideal for extended family or older relatives.\r\n•Upper-Level Retreat: Offers an additional second living area, two luxurious master suites, two extra well-proportioned bedrooms, and a sleek family bathroom.\r\n•Parking & Security: Internal-access double garage, a secure automated electric gate, and ample off-street parking for multiple vehicles.\r\n•Entertainment & Views: Seamless indoor-outdoor flow to expansive decking areas capturing stunning sea and Rangitoto Island views-perfect for hosting family and friends.\r\n•Unbeatable Education Zones: Situated within walking distance to Macleans College, Bucklands Beach Intermediate, and Pigeon Mountain Primary.\r\nHomes offering this incredible level of extensive renovation, supreme space, and elite school zoning are exceptionally rare in the heart of Bucklands Beach.",
